                            <Polygon POINTS="376 1913 374 1922 407 1936 409 1936 411 1938 617 1938 617 1936 619 1936 621 1936 637 1926 691 1936 693 1936 695 1936 697 1936 713 1926 797 1936 798 1936 800 1936 802 1936 816 1926 845 1938 847 1938 849 1938 1044 1928 1149 1938 1151 1938 1200 1928 1410 1940 1412 1940 1512 1930 1695 1940 1697 1940 1736 1932 1750 1942 1752 1942 1753 1942 1755 1942 1757 1942 1785 1932 1835 1942 1837 1942 1929 1932 2132 1936 2135 1920 2134 1881 376 1881 376 1913"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“the house of the strongest one”). The master of such a house is called"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-094_l26" HPOS="368" VPOS="1936" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="368 1979 2139 1979" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
